cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this book, please cite it as below."
type: book
title: "ROS 2: Zero to Robot — From First Node to Real Autonomous Mobile Robot"
abstract: >-
  A complete, project-based ROS 2 course written in English,
  covering everything from the first ROS 2 node to a fully deployed
  autonomous mobile robot: architecture, TF2, URDF/Xacro, Gazebo
  simulation, Nav2, MoveIt 2, multi-robot fleets, industrial hardware,
  CI/CD, and a practical SolidWorks-to-URDF appendix.
authors:
